WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,580
People can run away

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:07,820
The traces cannot be escaped. Hey Qiu Yu, I am Lin Yu.

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,620
I have something I want to talk to you about

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,820
Is it convenient to meet?

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,360
I'm afraid it's inconvenient

6
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,840
I've gone back to my hometown

7
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,200
Something happened at Yunfeng Milk Tea Shop

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,520
You should know what's going on

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,440
Yangfeng is looking for someone to visit my coffee shop

10
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:21,870
Something happens now

11
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,030
He was the first to run away

12
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,110
You are in the store every day

13
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:26,670
I don't believe you don't know anything

14
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,860
Mr. Lin, you misunderstood

15
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,700
I also found out after the fact

16
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,680
The police found me today

17
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,280
This matter has been investigated into a criminal case.

18
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,290
What did Yang Feng really hide?

19
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,800
You can't pick it in either
